        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked whether recognizing a right to counsel when a defendant is ordered held in custody would contradict any of our precedents."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "21a6ec4c1bb1def02b67d090cde6c98124d981b808a96654d8f2fb1e15e90e8c",
