            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer asked whether the Sixth Amendment right attaches when the State arrests an individual and intends to bring him to trial."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "21a6ec4c1bb1def02b67d090cde6c98124d981b808a96654d8f2fb1e15e90e8c",
