            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 44,
              "start": 44
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Souter, justice Souter questioned whether the right would be subject to a condition subsequent if there is no incarceration."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "21a6ec4c1bb1def02b67d090cde6c98124d981b808a96654d8f2fb1e15e90e8c",
