            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 50,
              "start": 50
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked whether the right is episodic\u2014turning on a critical event and ending when that event ends."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "21a6ec4c1bb1def02b67d090cde6c98124d981b808a96654d8f2fb1e15e90e8c",
